Expected output:
Senior decision points:
1. Match tool to dominant requirement
2. Never force one tool into the other's role
3. Pick one system of record (usually Kafka)
4. Monitor the bridge as first-class infra
5. Consider operational expertise availability
6. Kafka ecosystem is larger and more mature
7. Complementary > competitive
```
